{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jer-16-1","title":"Jeremiah 16:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The prophet, under the types of abstaining from marriage, from houses of mourning and feasting, foreshews the utter ruin of the Jews; 10 because they were worse than their fathers. 14 Their return from captivity shall be stranger than their deliverance out of Egypt. 16 God will doubly recompense their idolatry.</p>\n<p>The word. 1:2,4; 2:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-2","title":"Jeremiah 16:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Ge 19:14; Mt 24:19; Lu 21:23; 23:29; 1Co 7:26,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-3","title":"Jeremiah 16:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>thus saith 5,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-4","title":"Jeremiah 16:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>die. 14:16; 15:2,3; Ps 78:64 not. 5-7; 22:18; 25:33; Am 6:9,10 neither. 7:33; 22:19; 36:30; Ps 79:2,3 as dung. 8:1-3; 9:22; 25:33; 1Ki 14:10,11; 21:23,24; 2Ki 9:10,36,37 Ps 83:10; Isa 5:25; Zep 1:17 consumed. 14:15; 34:17; 44:12,27; Eze 5:12 meat. 34:20; Ps 79:2; Isa 18:6; Eze 39:17-20; Re 19:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-5","title":"Jeremiah 16:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Enter. 6,7; Eze 24:16-23 mourning. or, mourning feast. I have. 15:1-4; De 31:17; 2Ch 15:5,6; Isa 27:11; Zec 8:10; Re 6:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-6","title":"Jeremiah 16:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>the great. 13:13; Isa 9:14-17; 24:2; Eze 9:5,6; Am 6:11; Re 6:15; 20:12 they. 4; 22:18,19 nor cut. 7:29; 41:5; 47:5; 48:37; Le 19:28; De 14:1; Isa 22:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-7","title":"Jeremiah 16:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>tear themselves. or, break bread. De 26:14; Job 42:11; Eze 24:17; Ho 9:4 cup. Pr 31:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-8","title":"Jeremiah 16:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>15:17; Ps 26:4; Ec 7:2-4; Isa 22:12-14; Am 6:4-6; Mt 24:38 Lu 17:27-29; 1Co 5:11; Eph 5:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-9","title":"Jeremiah 16:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>I will. 7:34; 25:10; Isa 24:7-12; Eze 26:13; Ho 2:11; Re 18:22,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-10","title":"Jeremiah 16:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Wherefore. 2:35; 5:19; 13:22; 22:8,9; De 29:24,25; 1Ki 9:8,9; Ho 12:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-11","title":"Jeremiah 16:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Because. 2:8; 5:7-9; Jud 2:12,13; 10:13,14; Ne 9:26-29; Ps 106:35-41 Da 9:10-12 walked. 8:2; 9:14; Eze 11:21; 1Pe 4:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-12","title":"Jeremiah 16:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>worse. 7:26; 13:10; 2Ti 3:13 imagination. or, stubbornness. 7:24; 9:14; 13:10; *marg: De 9:27; 29:19; *marg: Jud 2:19; 1Sa 15:23 evil. 17:9; Ge 6:5; 8:21; Ec 8:12; 9:3; Mr 7:21; Heb 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-13","title":"Jeremiah 16:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>will I. 6:15; 15:4,14; 17:4; Le 18:27,28; De 4:26-28; 28:36,63-65; 29:28 De 30:17,18; Jos 23:15,16; 2Ch 7:20 into a. 14:8; 17:4; 22:28 and. De 4:28; 28:36; Ps 81:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-14","title":"Jeremiah 16:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>behold. 23:7,8; Isa 43:18,19; Ho 3:4,5 that brought. Ex 20:2; De 15:15; Mic 6:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-15","title":"Jeremiah 16:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>that brought. 3:18; 24:6; 30:3,10; 31:8; 32:37; 50:19; De 30:3-5; Ps 106:47 Isa 11:11-16; 13:5,6; 14:1; 27:12,13; Eze 34:12-14; 36:24; 37:21,22 Eze 39:28; Am 9:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-16","title":"Jeremiah 16:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>I will send.I will raise up enemies against them, some of whom shall destroy them by wiles, and others shall ruin them by violence. The Chaldeans shall make an entire conquest of the whole land, and strip it of its riches and inhabitants; and those who may escape one party shall fall into the hands of another.</p>\n<p>25:9; Am 4:2; Hab 1:14,15 hunters. Ge 10:9; 1Sa 24:11; 26:20; Mic 7:2 every mountain. Isa 24:17,18; Am 5:19; 9:1-3; Lu 17:34-37; Re 6:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-17","title":"Jeremiah 16:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>23:24; 32:19; 2Ch 16:9; Job 34:21,22; Ps 90:8; 139:3; Pr 5:21 Pr 15:3; Isa 29:15; Eze 8:12; 9:9; Lu 12:1,2; 1Co 4:5; Heb 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-18","title":"Jeremiah 16:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>first. 17:18; Isa 40:2; 61:7; Re 18:6 they have defiled. 2:7; 3:1,2,9; Le 18:27,28; Nu 35:33,34; Ps 106:38; Isa 24:5 Mic 2:10; Zep 3:1-5 the carcases. Le 26:30; Eze 11:18,21; 43:7-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-19","title":"Jeremiah 16:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>my strength. 17:17; Ps 18:1,2; 19:14; 27:5; 46:1,7,11; 62:2,7; 91:1,2; 144:1,2 Pr 18:10; Isa 25:4; 32:2; Eze 11:16; Na 1:7; Hab 3:19 Gentiles. 3:16,17; Ps 22:27-30; 67:2-7; 68:31; 72:8-12; 86:9; Isa 2:2,3 Isa 11:9,10; 49:6; 60:1-3; 62:2; Mic 4:1,2; Zec 2:11; 8:20-23 Mal 1:11; Re 7:9-11; 11:15 Surely. 3:23; 10:14,15; Hab 2:18,19; 1Pe 1:18 wherein. 2:11; 10:5; Isa 44:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-20","title":"Jeremiah 16:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Ps 115:4-8; 135:14-18; Isa 36:19; 37:19; Ho 8:4-6; Ac 19:26; Ga 1:8 Ga 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-16-21","title":"Jeremiah 16:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>I will this. Ex 9:14-18; 14:4; Ps 9:16; Eze 6:7; 24:24,27; 25:14 and they. 33:2; Ex 15:3; Ps 83:18; Isa 43:3; Am 5:8 The Lord. or, JEHOVAH.</p>"}]}